### What version of Codex CLI is running?

`codex-cli 0.163.0`, installed via npm (`@openai/codex`), native Windows x64.
The installed voice-runtime manifest also reports app version 0.163.0.

### What subscription do you have?

Not provided in this report.

### Which model were you using?

The configured text-task model is `gpt-6.1-sol`; the realtime voice model was not independently identified. The configured voice is `sol`.

### What platform is your computer?

Windows 11 Pro x64, version 10.0.26300, build 26300, accessed through a Windows Remote Desktop (RDP) session. This is the native Windows CLI, not WSL.

### What terminal emulator and version are you using (if applicable)?

PowerShell 7.6.7. Terminal emulator/version not independently identified.

